# Line endings are LF everywhere — in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# src/.editorconfig sets `end_of_line = lf`, and `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` is part of the
# Phase 7 exit criterion. Without this file a Windows checkout would convert on the way in, and the
# format check would fail on files nobody edited.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The Docker images run these; a CRLF shebang line fails with a confusing "not found".
*.sh text eol=lf
